{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45079","headline":"奉同颜使君真卿袁侍御骆驼桥翫月 · 皎然","name":"奉同颜使君真卿袁侍御骆驼桥翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山中常见月，不及共游时。\n水上恐将缺，林端爱落迟。\n乌惊宪府客，人咏鲍家诗。\n永夜南桥望，裴回若有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}